      "value": "<p>A cut tunnel system forty metres into the night-side ice, at the point where the march comes closest to the antistellar front, used for storage and as a staging point for ice cutting. There are twelve entrances, all on the marchward face. Nobody lives in it: people stay for days at a time and then leave, a distinction the local account is careful to make.</p>",
